{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
appointment_notes.liquid — mirror an appointment's notes into the intranet
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The ServiceMinder Open API cannot read appointment notes at all (see
serviceminder/liquid/README.md for the verification against appt 51051472).
Liquid can, via appointment.notes / appointment.appointment_notes.

Use this for appointment events OTHER than cancellation — completed visits,
reschedules — so the rep's write-up ("measured, needs a soffit removed",
"homeowner's husband wasn't there, revisit") reaches the intranet instead of
living only in the SM UI. For cancellations use cancellation_notes.liquid,
which additionally carries the cancel reason.

INSTALL (once per brand — notifications are per-organization):
  Control Panel -> Notifications -> Appointment Completed
    body format: PLAIN TEXT (HTML escapes the JSON and breaks the parser)
    SUBJECT: SM-APPT {{ appointment.id }}
    deliver to: the intranet ingest address

Private notes are included and flagged. Filtering them out of any
customer-facing surface is the reader's job, not this template's.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
---SM-NOTES-JSON-BEGIN---
{
  "source": "appointment",
  "brand": {{ appointment.organization.name | json }},
  "contact_id": {{ appointment.contact_id | json }},
  "appointment_id": {{ appointment.id | json }},
  "proposal_id": {{ appointment.proposal_id | json }},
  "subject_label": {{ appointment.contact_name | append: " — " | append: appointment.service.name | json }},
  "cancel_reason_id": {{ appointment.cancel_reason.id | json }},
  "cancel_reason": {{ appointment.cancel_reason.name | json }},
  "cancelled_at": {{ appointment.cancelled_at | json }},
  "notes": [
    {%- for n in appointment.notes -%}
    {
      "id": {{ n.id | json }},
      "title": {{ n.title | json }},
      "body": {{ n.body | json }},
      "private": {{ n.private | json }},
      "created_at": {{ n.created_at | json }},
      "created_by": {{ n.created_by.name | json }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
---SM-NOTES-JSON-END---
